      "description": "The text 'president trump has suggested random drug tests be performed on members of congress' is juxtaposed with images of Nancy Pelosi, Chuck Schumer, and a Black woman speaker. This mapping implies that these individuals are being targeted or are somehow 'unfit' due to the fictional or exaggerated premise. The meme uses the visual material of these political figures to represent the subjects of the text's claim, creating an analogical mapping where the text's subject (the proposal) is visually embodied by the politicians shown.",
